{"id": "UgxBGRS3p0OKNH2JsDh4AaABAg.AZN61tkRcWoAZN66JBDdFW", "parent": "UgxBGRS3p0OKNH2JsDh4AaABAg", "likes": 0, "text": "This is such a great point. I used to clutter my charts with five different indicators and ended up completely paralyzed by conflicting signals.", "published": "2026-07-17T16:01:48", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgxBGRS3p0OKNH2JsDh4AaABAg.AZN61tkRcWoAZN68L7Du7d", "parent": "UgxBGRS3p0OKNH2JsDh4AaABAg", "likes": 0, "text": "Same here. One would say buy, the other would say sell, and I'd just end up guessing. It's an exhausting way to trade.", "published": "2026-07-17T16:02:05", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgxBGRS3p0OKNH2JsDh4AaABAg.AZN61tkRcWoAZN6F0lMboE", "parent": "UgxBGRS3p0OKNH2JsDh4AaABAg", "likes": 0, "text": "If most standard indicators are lagging, what tools should a beginner actually focus on to see where the market is really moving?", "published": "2026-07-17T16:02:59", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgxBGRS3p0OKNH2JsDh4AaABAg.AZN61tkRcWoAZN6G0Yb_DZ", "parent": "UgxBGRS3p0OKNH2JsDh4AaABAg", "likes": 0, "text": "Focus heavily on market volume and structural support/demand zones. Volume shows you the actual strength behind a move rather than just a delayed mathematical formula.", "published": "2026-07-17T16:03:07", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgxBGRS3p0OKNH2JsDh4AaABAg.AZN61tkRcWoAZN6Ha3eXC0", "parent": "UgxBGRS3p0OKNH2JsDh4AaABAg", "likes": 0, "text": "Did you learn how to track those volume profiles and institutional footprints on your own?", "published": "2026-07-17T16:03:20", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgxBGRS3p0OKNH2JsDh4AaABAg.AZN61tkRcWoAZN6IJZKN9a", "parent": "UgxBGRS3p0OKNH2JsDh4AaABAg", "likes": 0, "text": "Everything changed when I learned how to read those structural setups properly under the guidance of Demitry Jenkins.", "published": "2026-07-17T16:03:26", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgxBGRS3p0OKNH2JsDh4AaABAg.AZN61tkRcWoAZN6KWzyDus", "parent": "UgxBGRS3p0OKNH2JsDh4AaABAg", "likes": 0, "text": "I've been looking for a solid mentorship program. Does he actually break down these complex volume concepts simply for people who are new?", "published": "2026-07-17T16:03:44", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgxBGRS3p0OKNH2JsDh4AaABAg.AZN61tkRcWoAZN6L_ND2aA", "parent": "UgxBGRS3p0OKNH2JsDh4AaABAg", "likes": 0, "text": "he keeps it completely straightforward. He focuses on practical, logical execution and strict risk parameters so you don't get overwhelmed by chart noise.", "published": "2026-07-17T16:03:53", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgxBGRS3p0OKNH2JsDh4AaABAg.AZN61tkRcWoAZN6R-9_ucl", "parent": "UgxBGRS3p0OKNH2JsDh4AaABAg", "likes": 0, "text": "That sounds exactly like the kind of structure I need to stop trading emotionally. Where does he share his updates or connect with people?", "published": "2026-07-17T16:04:37", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
